00:15:51,294 --> 00:15:53,185
berpikiran sama?

233
00:15:53,791 --> 00:15:54,666
Bagaimana?

234
00:15:54,750 --> 00:15:57,125
Kalau kau terbang ke Kanada
2 minggu lagi bersama Bobby...

235
00:15:57,208 --> 00:15:59,750
- Bersama Sunny.
- Apalah arti sebuah nama.

236
00:16:00,833 --> 00:16:01,875
Selama 15 hari ke depan,

237
00:16:01,958 --> 00:16:03,741
kita buat anak buah Gajraj percaya

238
00:16:03,742 --> 00:16:05,268
kalau aku ini pacarmu.

239
00:16:05,375 --> 00:16:06,250
Mantap!

240
00:16:06,333 --> 00:16:07,791
Maka kau akan lepas
dari radar mereka.

241
00:16:09,375 --> 00:16:10,250
Sederhana.

242
00:16:11,583 --> 00:16:12,500
Tapi, Praja...

243
00:16:13,958 --> 00:16:15,000
kau sudah menikah.

244
00:16:15,333 --> 00:16:16,750
Aku punya istri terbaik.

245
00:16:17,125 --> 00:16:19,333
Dia akan mendukungku
setelah kujelaskan rencananya.

246
00:16:20,000 --> 00:16:21,000
Aku akan beritahu dia hari ini.

247
00:16:25,000 --> 00:16:26,750
Sayang, kau di rumah?

248
00:16:27,875 --> 00:16:29,041
Aku di rumah, sayang.

249
00:16:30,291 --> 00:16:31,416
Luar biasa, Pandey ji.

250
00:16:31,833 --> 00:16:33,666
Aroma masakannya

251
00:16:33,750 --> 00:16:35,333
sudah menyambutku
di gerbang komplek.

252
00:16:35,708 --> 00:16:37,583
Ditambah lagi,
"Sayang, kau di rumah?"

253
00:16:37,666 --> 00:16:39,750
Memangnya kenapa
aku bilang begitu?

254
00:16:39,916 --> 00:16:41,041
Kalau soal romantisme,

255
00:16:41,500 --> 00:16:43,458
UP kalahkan AS dengan mudah.

256
00:16:43,791 --> 00:16:45,416
Terbukti dari populasinya.

257
00:16:45,833 --> 00:16:47,458
Kalau ada penghargaan
untuk omong kosong,

258
00:16:47,541 --> 00:16:49,000
kau pasti menang mudah.

259
00:16:49,083 --> 00:16:51,916
Aku bisa meningkatkan standar
dalam banyak hal,

260
00:16:52,000 --> 00:16:53,541
tapi kau tidak mengizinkanku.

261
00:16:53,875 --> 00:16:54,833
Sungguh?

262
00:16:55,500 --> 00:16:56,458
Baik, dengar!

263
00:16:56,916 --> 00:16:58,625
Aku punya sesuatu yang penting.

264
00:16:59,541 --> 00:17:00,666
Aku butuh bantuanmu.

265
00:17:00,791 --> 00:17:02,625
Aku juga ada hal penting.

266
00:17:02,708 --> 00:17:03,625
Oh ya?

267
00:17:04,000 --> 00:17:04,875
Kau duluan.

268
00:17:04,958 --> 00:17:05,833
Tidak, kau.

269
00:17:05,916 --> 00:17:07,583
- Tidak, kau.
- Kau.

270
00:17:07,708 --> 00:17:09,250
Sayang, kau duluan!

271
00:17:09,333 --> 00:17:10,208
Baik!

272
00:17:12,666 --> 00:17:15,791
- Lihat ini.
- Punya video untukku... sayang?

273
00:17:16,166 --> 00:17:18,208
<b>SIAPA KEKASIH RAHASIA
SUDHANSHU TIWARI?<b>

274
00:17:19,791 --> 00:17:23,125
Ada orang bodoh
yang membocorkan foto ini...

275
00:17:24,083 --> 00:17:27,125
Aku memecahkan cerita ini
3 hari lalu.

276
00:17:27,375 --> 00:17:30,458
Sejak saat itu,
ayahnya Sunny mencarinya.

277
00:17:30,625 --> 00:17:32,208
Kau tahu siapa yang bersamanya?

278
00:17:33,041 --> 00:17:33,916
Siapa?

279
00:17:34,458 --> 00:17:35,583
Kekasihnya.

280
00:17:37,625 --> 00:17:40,833
- Hebat!
- Gajraj Tiwari akan memenggalku.

281
00:17:42,083 --> 00:17:44,958
Gajraj Tiwari meneleponku hari ini

282
00:17:45,500 --> 00:17:48,750
dan bilang,
kalau aku temukan gadis ini...

283
00:17:51,083 --> 00:17:56,541
dia akan luncurkan channel-ku
sendiri, Pandey ji!

284
00:17:58,833 --> 00:18:00,083
Gagal sudah rencana itu.

285
00:18:01,541 --> 00:18:03,833
Dia akan wujudkan
mimpi masa kecilku,

286
00:18:06,166 --> 00:18:07,125
demi satu tugas kecil.

287
00:18:07,750 --> 00:18:09,208
Hanya sebuah nama.

288
00:18:10,583 --> 00:18:12,458
Dan kau tahu aku, Pandey ji.

289
00:18:13,416 --> 00:18:15,583
Demi impianku,

290
00:18:16,041 --> 00:18:17,541
pasti kutemukan dia.

291
00:18:17,875 --> 00:18:18,750
Siapa?

292
00:18:18,833 --> 00:18:21,041
Orangnya yang bersamamu.

293
00:18:21,375 --> 00:18:22,583
Aku?

294
00:18:23,291 --> 00:18:24,166
Iya.

295
00:18:32,791 --> 00:18:33,958
Mirza Ghalib.

296
00:18:39,958 --> 00:18:41,208
Siapa wanita itu?

297
00:18:42,208 --> 00:18:43,166
Siapa perempuannya?

298
00:18:43,250 --> 00:18:44,833
Yang mana?

299
00:18:45,083 --> 00:18:46,416
Teman wanitamu.

300
00:18:46,500 --> 00:18:47,833
Orang yang menurut sumber,

301
00:18:47,916 --> 00:18:49,000
datang dengan wajah tegang.

302
00:18:49,458 --> 00:18:51,708
Dan kau pergi bersamanya,
saat dia sedang menangis.

303
00:18:51,791 --> 00:18:53,500
Jumman itu omong kosong.

304
00:18:53,791 --> 00:18:56,750
Temanku... teman kuliah...

305
00:18:56,875 --> 00:18:57,791
- Iya.
- Chanchal.

306
00:18:58,083 --> 00:19:01,833
Sebenarnya, dia sedang
menghadapi masalah rumah tangga.

307
00:19:02,125 --> 00:19:03,000
KDRT.

308
00:19:03,083 --> 00:19:04,666
Dia bisa saja ke polisi.

309
00:19:05,500 --> 00:19:06,916
Ngapain dia ke dinas kehutanan?

310
00:19:07,875 --> 00:19:09,208
Apa suaminya binatang?

311
00:19:10,083 --> 00:19:12,250
Dia tidak kenal siapa pun di sini,

312
00:19:12,333 --> 00:19:15,541
jadi aku ikut saja
untuk dukungan moral.

313
00:19:15,625 --> 00:19:17,458
Kalau memang begitu, tidak apa.

314
00:19:17,708 --> 00:19:21,166
Dia boleh-boleh saja ceria,
tidak masalah.

315
00:19:21,583 --> 00:19:25,750
Tapi kalau kau mulai
bermain-main karena dia,

316
00:19:26,625 --> 00:19:28,250
aku yang akan turun tangan.

317
00:19:30,166 --> 00:19:32,750
Bagaimanapun,
istrimu adalah temanku.

318
00:19:32,916 --> 00:19:33,958
Apa aku musuhmu?

319
00:19:34,375 --> 00:19:35,916
Ayolah, kau sahabatku.

320
00:19:36,458 --> 00:19:39,625
Tapi aku pegang satu aturan.
Saudara sebelum pria.

321
00:19:40,083 --> 00:19:41,000
Pandey!

322
00:19:49,666 --> 00:19:50,916
Apa maksudmu, "tenang"?

323
00:19:51,458 --> 00:19:52,625
Memang kenapa?

324
00:19:53,666 --> 00:19:55,208
Berjanjilah kau tidak akan

325
00:19:55,291 --> 00:19:57,208
melempar cappuccino itu padaku
setelah mendengar ini.

326
00:19:57,333 --> 00:19:59,500
Lupakan cappuccino-nya, Praja.
Langsung saja!

327
00:19:59,791 --> 00:20:03,583
"Narasumber" yang kau sebut tadi,

328
00:20:03,666 --> 00:20:05,125
yang punya motif pribadi,

329
00:20:06,333 --> 00:20:07,500
yang membocorkan fotomu,

330
00:20:07,875 --> 00:20:09,416
adalah...

331
00:20:11,083 --> 00:20:12,375
istriku.

332
00:20:18,166 --> 00:20:19,750
Kau sudah janji padaku.
Demi persahabatan kita.

333
00:20:20,625 --> 00:20:21,500
Persahabatan?

334
00:20:21,583 --> 00:20:24,500
1 foto bocor itu
sudah menghancurkan segalanya.

335
00:20:24,750 --> 00:20:25,875
Nyawaku terancam.

336
00:20:26,750 --> 00:20:29,166
Aku tidak bisa bertemu
atau bicara dengan Sunny.

337
00:20:29,250 --> 00:20:30,125
Sunny siapa?

338
00:20:30,583 --> 00:20:32,041
Sunny-mu!

339
00:20:32,625 --> 00:20:33,541
Sunny-mu!

340
00:20:37,416 --> 00:20:38,291
Jangan!

341
00:20:43,791 --> 00:20:44,791
Dengar, Praja.

342
00:20:45,750 --> 00:20:47,208
Sesuai rencana jeniusmu,

343
00:20:47,458 --> 00:20:49,208
aku sudah beritahu semua orang
aku akan datang 2 hari lagi

344
00:20:49,333 --> 00:20:52,583
dengan pacarku
ke pernikahan temanku.

345
00:20:53,791 --> 00:20:54,916
Dan sengaja,

346
00:20:55,916 --> 00:20:57,833
biar anak buah Gajraj mendengarnya.

347
00:20:57,916 --> 00:21:00,125
Bagaimana aku jelaskan ini
padamu, Chanchal?

348
00:21:01,000 --> 00:21:03,791
Aku tidak pernah melakukan apa pun
tanpa sepengetahuan istriku.

349
00:21:04,708 --> 00:21:07,708
Kau tahu ibu mertuaku
pengacara pengadilan keluarga,

350
00:21:07,791 --> 00:21:08,875
- dan ayah mertuaku--
- Seorang hakim.

351
00:21:08,958 --> 00:21:09,875
Persis!

352
00:21:10,083 --> 00:21:11,500
Aku pria menikah yang terhormat.

353
00:21:12,291 --> 00:21:14,625
Sampai kemarin, aku mau melakukannya
karena kukira istriku akan ikut serta,

354
00:21:14,708 --> 00:21:15,750
jadi aku tidak takut.

355
00:21:16,208 --> 00:21:18,708
Dan sekarang,
aku tiba-tiba takut.

356
00:21:19,250 --> 00:21:21,583
Kalau begitu...

357
00:21:23,416 --> 00:21:25,375
telan rasa takutmu dengan cappuccino-mu.

358
00:21:25,708 --> 00:21:26,875
Tepati janjimu!

359
00:21:27,875 --> 00:21:29,708
Jadilah pria, Praja!

360
00:21:30,750 --> 00:21:32,583
Dan kalau bukan demi persahabatan,

361
00:21:32,916 --> 00:21:34,291
lakukan karena rasa bersalah.

362
00:21:35,333 --> 00:21:36,583
Karena, berkat istrimu,

363
00:21:37,166 --> 00:21:39,208
aku ada dalam masalah ini.

364
00:21:41,375 --> 00:21:42,750
Masalah macam apa yang kuhadapi?

365
00:21:42,833 --> 00:21:44,583
Akulah yang terjebak di sini, Praja.

366
00:21:44,708 --> 00:21:46,375
Apa yang tadi kupikirkan?

367
00:21:47,333 --> 00:21:48,291
Kakak dan kakak ipar? Kau?

368
00:21:49,083 --> 00:21:50,041
Semua baik-baik saja?

369
00:21:57,375 --> 00:21:58,416
Kau mau makan,

370
00:21:58,500 --> 00:22:02,375
atau terus main hoki
dengan makananmu?

371
00:22:02,458 --> 00:22:04,208
Agak pedas sedikit!

372
00:22:04,416 --> 00:22:05,291
Tidak sama sekali!

373
00:22:05,583 --> 00:22:06,875
Nilofer yang membuatnya.

374
00:22:06,958 --> 00:22:07,916
Nilofer?

375
00:22:08,583 --> 00:22:09,458
Dia yang membawanya.

376
00:22:09,541 --> 00:22:11,083
Apa dia bilang sesuatu?

377
00:22:11,625 --> 00:22:12,583
Memangnya dia mau bilang apa?

378
00:22:12,750 --> 00:22:13,625
Ada apa denganmu?

379
00:22:13,708 --> 00:22:14,583
Tidak--

380
00:22:14,666 --> 00:22:15,625
Bosku,

381
00:22:15,708 --> 00:22:16,875
Sharma ji,

382
00:22:17,750 --> 00:22:19,750
memberiku tugas aneh.

383
00:22:20,291 --> 00:22:21,666
Ini tentang makanan--

384
00:22:21,833 --> 00:22:25,541
Maksudku, laporan
rehabilitasi kura-kura.

385
00:22:25,625 --> 00:22:26,541
Kura-kura?

386
00:22:26,708 --> 00:22:27,583
Rehabilitasi-nya.

387
00:22:27,916 --> 00:22:30,750
Aku mungkin harus dinas
ke luar kota mulai besok.

388
00:22:32,041 --> 00:22:33,708
Mungkin beberapa kali lagi minggu ini.

389
00:22:33,875 --> 00:22:34,750
Ke mana?

390
00:22:34,833 --> 00:22:36,416
Bana-- Kanpur.

391
00:22:37,291 --> 00:22:38,250
- Baiklah.
- Kanpur.

392
00:22:44,875 --> 00:22:46,875
{\an8}CINTA BHAIYA JI

393
00:22:50,250 --> 00:22:53,708
Ini brilian.

394
00:22:54,458 --> 00:22:55,833
Wajah-wajah imut di mana-mana.

395
00:22:56,000 --> 00:22:58,250
Jangan terbawa suasana.

396
00:22:58,583 --> 00:23:01,416
Kalau salah satu wajah imut ini
datang dengan sendal,

397
00:23:01,750 --> 00:23:04,291
pipimu akan menyala terang.

398
00:23:05,041 --> 00:23:07,250
Fokus pada Nona Chanchal Kumari.

399
00:23:07,333 --> 00:23:08,583
Kau pengecut sekali.

400
00:23:08,750 --> 00:23:09,625
Ayo.

401
00:23:17,333 --> 00:23:18,291
Aku segera kembali.

402
00:23:32,791 --> 00:23:35,541
- Kau di sini.
- Apa yang kau lakukan?

403
00:23:36,000 --> 00:23:37,000
Chanchal!

404
00:23:37,708 --> 00:23:38,666
Dari mana saja?

405
00:23:38,750 --> 00:23:39,625
Aku?

406
00:23:40,291 --> 00:23:42,041
Bagaimana bisa kau
membuatku menunggu?

407
00:23:42,125 --> 00:23:44,208
Aku tidak datang
dengan mobilku sendiri, kan?

408
00:23:47,458 --> 00:23:48,916
Alasan baru setiap saat.

409
00:23:49,000 --> 00:23:49,958
Alasan?

410
00:23:50,375 --> 00:23:52,583
- Kau imut sekali, sayang.
- Imut?

411
00:23:52,916 --> 00:23:54,083
Rasanya ingin kumakan saja.

412
00:23:54,166 --> 00:23:55,125
Dimakan?

413
00:23:57,791 --> 00:23:59,625
Kau mabuk?

414
00:24:00,791 --> 00:24:01,750
Praja.

415
00:24:02,000 --> 00:24:03,666
2 preman di belakangmu itu...

416
00:24:05,583 --> 00:24:07,291
adalah anak buah Gajraj.

417
00:24:09,500 --> 00:24:11,333
Sekarang, saat aku mundur,

418
00:24:11,833 --> 00:24:13,250
kau cium pipiku.

419
00:24:13,541 --> 00:24:14,416
Cium?!

420
00:24:14,500 --> 00:24:15,375
Aku tidak mau!

421
00:24:15,458 --> 00:24:16,583
Lalu, apa?

422
00:24:17,750 --> 00:24:19,708
Praja, ini cuma akting.

423
00:24:19,833 --> 00:24:20,750
Iya.

424
00:24:20,833 --> 00:24:22,666
Jadi, lewati saja
kuliah moralnya

425
00:24:23,250 --> 00:24:24,166
dan cium saja!

426
00:24:24,916 --> 00:24:26,541
- Mereka melihat.
- Ya.

427
00:24:28,000 --> 00:24:29,291
Maafkan aku, Aparna.

428
00:24:29,500 --> 00:24:30,791
Cium aku, Praja.

429
00:24:35,625 --> 00:24:36,833
Si manis sudah makan?

430
00:24:37,916 --> 00:24:38,791
Ayo!

431
00:24:38,875 --> 00:24:40,916
Kenapa dia ragu-ragu sekali?

432
00:24:41,250 --> 00:24:43,458
Karena dia pemalu.

433
00:24:43,791 --> 00:24:46,500
Tidak semua orang mesum sepertimu.

434
00:24:47,500 --> 00:24:48,875
Kalau dia pacarnya,

435
00:24:49,125 --> 00:24:50,125
kenapa ragu?

436
00:24:52,500 --> 00:24:53,791
Ayo masuk dan lihat ke dalam.

437
00:24:58,666 --> 00:25:00,250
Tenang, Pandey.

438
00:25:00,791 --> 00:25:01,666
Namaste.

439
00:25:01,750 --> 00:25:02,666
<i>Walaikum Assalam.</i>

440
00:25:03,291 --> 00:25:05,000
Ya, terima kasih.

441
00:25:09,708 --> 00:25:11,500
Apa yang kau lakukan, Chanchal?

442
00:25:11,791 --> 00:25:14,000
Duduk di pangkuan pacarku.

443
00:25:15,875 --> 00:25:16,833
Mereka melihat.

444
00:25:18,333 --> 00:25:19,541
Mainkan rambutnya.

445
00:25:21,458 --> 00:25:24,916
- Bukan rambutmu, rambutku, Praja.
- Oke.

446
00:25:26,791 --> 00:25:27,875
Tunjukkan sedikit perasaan.

447
00:25:29,000 --> 00:25:30,166
Perasaan!

448
00:25:34,166 --> 00:25:35,916
Chanchal, bangun, kumohon.

449
00:25:36,041 --> 00:25:36,916
Diam!

450
00:25:38,000 --> 00:25:38,875
Aku tidak menikmati ini.

451
00:25:39,583 --> 00:25:41,416
Biarkan mereka pergi dulu,
baru aku bangun.

452
00:25:41,500 --> 00:25:42,375
Oke.

453
00:25:43,750 --> 00:25:44,750
Mereka masih di sekitar sini?

454
00:25:48,833 --> 00:25:49,708
Akhirnya, mereka pergi.

455
00:25:50,958 --> 00:25:53,458
- Kau membuatku melakukan semua ini.
- Karena itu aku memanggilmu ke sini.

456
00:25:54,500 --> 00:25:55,375
Apa?

457
00:25:57,041 --> 00:25:57,916
Kita kacau.

458
00:25:58,083 --> 00:25:59,083
Chanchal!

459
00:26:00,166 --> 00:26:01,041
Chanchal!

460
00:26:01,166 --> 00:26:03,000
- Namaste.
- Dari kejauhan,

461
00:26:03,083 --> 00:26:04,208
aku sudah mengenalimu.

462
00:26:04,541 --> 00:26:06,000
Munnu, ini Chanchal didi-mu.

463
00:26:06,083 --> 00:26:06,958
Ambil berkatnya.

464
00:26:07,041 --> 00:26:07,958
Salam, Kakak.

465
00:26:09,166 --> 00:26:11,666
- Menantu? Alhamdulillah, Chanchal.
- Sebenarnya--

466
00:26:11,750 --> 00:26:12,875
Kau sudah mapan.

467
00:26:12,958 --> 00:26:14,291
Apa kabar, menantu?

468
00:26:14,375 --> 00:26:15,541
- Menantu...?
- Tunggu.

469
00:26:15,625 --> 00:26:16,541
Biar kuperkenalkan diri.

470
00:26:16,708 --> 00:26:18,458
Aku sepupu ayahnya.

471
00:26:18,625 --> 00:26:21,208
Kami tumbuh seperti saudara.

472
00:26:21,291 --> 00:26:22,416
Tidak adil

473
00:26:22,500 --> 00:26:24,541
dia meninggal begitu cepat.

474
00:26:24,625 --> 00:26:28,083
Aku bersumpah, Nak.
Aku berusaha tetap terhubung.

475
00:26:28,166 --> 00:26:30,125
Tapi aku sendiri punya enam anak.

476
00:26:30,291 --> 00:26:31,583
Ini anak tengahku, Munnu.

477
00:26:31,666 --> 00:26:32,541
Ambil berkat kakak iparmu.

478
00:26:32,625 --> 00:26:33,500
- Salam, Kakak Ipar.
- Kakak ipar?!

479
00:26:33,583 --> 00:26:34,458
Tuhan memberkatimu, Nak.
Bangun!

480
00:26:34,666 --> 00:26:36,041
Tante, aku bukan suaminya.

481
00:26:36,125 --> 00:26:37,416
Kalian belum menikah?

482
00:26:37,500 --> 00:26:38,958
- Dengar--
- Tidak apa.

483
00:26:39,041 --> 00:26:40,875
Melihat Chanchal di pangkuanmu,

484
00:26:41,000 --> 00:26:42,333
hatiku puas.

485
00:26:42,541 --> 00:26:44,083
Sekarang ini, India sudah baru.

486
00:26:44,166 --> 00:26:46,500
Live-in bisa jadi
pasangan hidup dalam sekejap.

487
00:26:46,583 --> 00:26:48,541
Tuhan akhirnya menjawab doaku.

488
00:26:48,666 --> 00:26:50,291
Andai orang tuanya masih hidup,

489
00:26:50,375 --> 00:26:52,041
mereka pasti sangat bahagia.
Biar kuberitahu.

490
00:26:52,125 --> 00:26:53,000
Tunggu.

491
00:26:53,166 --> 00:26:54,041
Tunggu...

492
00:26:55,375 --> 00:26:56,250
Tunggu, menantu.

493
00:26:56,333 --> 00:26:57,833
Ini, terimalah.

494
00:26:57,916 --> 00:26:58,791
Ini tanda keberuntungan.

495
00:26:58,875 --> 00:27:00,791
- Jangan menolak. Demi aku.
- Ada apa ini?

496
00:27:00,875 --> 00:27:01,750
Demi aku!

497
00:27:02,708 --> 00:27:03,833
Bagus!

498
00:27:03,916 --> 00:27:06,166
Ini ulang tahun
anak bungsuku Bunnu tanggal 22.

499
00:27:06,250 --> 00:27:08,041
Kalian harus datang, ya.

500
00:27:08,125 --> 00:27:09,041
Kau bawa menantunya?

501
00:27:09,125 --> 00:27:10,000
Menantu, kau akan datang, kan?

502
00:27:10,083 --> 00:27:11,625
Demi aku!

503
00:27:11,708 --> 00:27:12,583
Bagus.

504
00:27:12,666 --> 00:27:14,916
Nanti alamatnya kukirim lewat chat.
Tempatnya sudah dipesan.

505
00:27:15,041 --> 00:27:16,375
Aku harus buru-buru sekarang.

506
00:27:16,541 --> 00:27:19,208
Kalau bapaknya Munnu tidak makan tepat waktu,
dia bisa sakit maag.

507
00:27:19,291 --> 00:27:20,458
Baik.
Ambil berkatnya, Munnu.

508
00:27:20,541 --> 00:27:21,750
- Sudah, tidak usah.
- Salam, Kakak Ipar.

509
00:27:21,916 --> 00:27:23,041
- Tidak apa. Ayo, Nak.
- Pergi.

510
00:27:23,208 --> 00:27:24,458
Kalian harus datang.

511
00:27:24,541 --> 00:27:25,416
Dadah, Chanchal.

512
00:27:25,875 --> 00:27:26,750
Menantu.

513
00:27:29,583 --> 00:27:31,458
Aku tidak menyangka dia akan muncul.

514
00:27:32,000 --> 00:27:33,125
Kan sudah kubilang.

515
00:27:33,208 --> 00:27:34,666
Aku harus apakan ini?

516
00:27:35,083 --> 00:27:37,083
Katamu kau tidak punya saudara.

517
00:27:37,375 --> 00:27:39,458
Jadi, dari mana tiba-tiba
tante ini muncul?

518
00:27:39,750 --> 00:27:40,625
Dan anaknya,

519
00:27:40,708 --> 00:27:43,291
kenapa dia sujud di kaki orang
setiap dua menit?

520
00:27:43,416 --> 00:27:46,416
Setidaknya pastikan dulu orangnya
ini kakak iparnya apa bukan?

521
00:27:46,500 --> 00:27:47,833
- Tapi--
- "Salam, Kakak."

522
00:27:47,916 --> 00:27:48,916
"Salam, Kakak Ipar."

523
00:27:49,125 --> 00:27:51,208
Sumpah, rasanya ingin kutampar dia
sampai berputar seperti gasing.

524
00:27:51,541 --> 00:27:53,041
Dia sepupu ayahku, Praja.

525
00:27:54,000 --> 00:27:55,833
Aku bertemu dia lagi setelah 2 tahun.

526
00:27:55,916 --> 00:27:57,625
Lalu apa gunanya

527
00:27:57,875 --> 00:27:59,583
menguras tabungan Paman

528
00:27:59,708 --> 00:28:02,375
lalu membagi-bagikan uang?

529
00:28:02,916 --> 00:28:03,791
Itu memang kebiasaannya.

530
00:28:03,875 --> 00:28:05,666
- Jangan tanya!
- Aneh sekali!

531
00:28:05,750 --> 00:28:06,625
{\an8}Dia memang begitu.

532
00:28:06,958 --> 00:28:09,333
{\an8}Kak, rokokmu.

533
00:28:09,416 --> 00:28:10,291
Terima kasih, Bablu.

534
00:28:13,333 --> 00:28:16,541
Aku sedang berbagi krisis hidupku di sini,

535
00:28:16,625 --> 00:28:19,041
kau malah ingin rokok?

536
00:28:20,416 --> 00:28:21,791
Kau sudah berubah, Chanchal.

537
00:28:22,083 --> 00:28:23,750
Aku tidak akan membantumu
kalau tahu begini.

538
00:28:29,125 --> 00:28:30,416
Ini sudah hari keenam, Praja.

539
00:28:31,291 --> 00:28:32,958
Tidak ada telepon,
tidak ada pertemuan.

540
00:28:33,583 --> 00:28:37,375
Cuma ini satu-satunya cara
Sunny dan aku terhubung.

541
00:28:41,083 --> 00:28:43,208
<b>AKU SANGAT MERINDUKANMU
AKU TIDAK BISA TIDUR SEMALAM<b>

542
00:28:49,125 --> 00:28:51,916
Katanya surat-surat ke Kanada
akan siap dalam 8 sampai 10 hari.

543
00:28:53,000 --> 00:28:55,041
Sampai saat itu,
ayahnya tidak boleh curiga.

544
00:28:58,083 --> 00:28:59,250
Kau tahu, Praja!

545
00:28:59,708 --> 00:29:03,041
Pergi, beritahu istrimu yang sebenarnya.

546
00:29:04,291 --> 00:29:06,958
Maka tinggal aku dan takdirku.

547
00:29:07,708 --> 00:29:09,416
Gajraj akan menembakku.

548
00:29:10,958 --> 00:29:12,875
Kau bisa datang ke pemakamanku
dan beri penghormatan.

549
00:29:23,291 --> 00:29:26,375
Dia lengket sekali tadi.
Wajahnya menempel di wajahnya.

550
00:29:26,833 --> 00:29:29,000
Menciumnya di depan umum...

551
00:29:31,625 --> 00:29:33,041
Tidak mungkin itu tante-nya, kan?

552
00:29:34,750 --> 00:29:35,666
Pasti itu pacarnya.

553
00:29:36,708 --> 00:29:38,041
Itulah maksudku, Pak.

554
00:29:39,541 --> 00:29:41,958
Tapi Surinder tidak mau terima.

555
00:29:43,250 --> 00:29:45,000
Mahinder itu naif, Pak.

556
00:29:45,500 --> 00:29:47,541
Iya, dia duduk di pangkuannya,

557
00:29:47,916 --> 00:29:50,875
tapi rasanya tidak ada
chemistry di antara mereka.

558
00:29:59,541 --> 00:30:02,750
Coba eja "chemistry" untukku.

559
00:30:05,458 --> 00:30:06,333
Chemistry?

560
00:30:06,541 --> 00:30:07,625
Pak, chemistry...

561
00:30:07,916 --> 00:30:09,250
Dimulai dengan K...

562
00:30:10,375 --> 00:30:12,333
lalu A... lalu Y.

563
00:30:12,416 --> 00:30:13,416
Cukup!

564
00:30:13,625 --> 00:30:15,625
Jangan ada kata lagi,

565
00:30:15,875 --> 00:30:18,041
atau bahasa Inggris akan
mati mengenaskan.

566
00:30:19,041 --> 00:30:21,583
Bagaimana dengan 2 gadis lainnya?
Ada kabar?

567
00:30:21,750 --> 00:30:22,875
Sedang kukerjakan, Pak.

568
00:30:23,416 --> 00:30:25,875
Beri aku beberapa hari untuk selidiki...

569
00:30:29,458 --> 00:30:31,416
Aku tidak tahu ejaannya, Pak.

570
00:30:32,708 --> 00:30:34,875
Aku akan gali info lebih
dan laporkan kembali.

571
00:30:35,000 --> 00:30:36,833
Laporkan kembali dan cepat!

572
00:30:37,291 --> 00:30:38,500
Atau aku harus menghadiahi
reporter wanita itu

573
00:30:38,583 --> 00:30:40,500
seluruh saluran TV.

574
00:30:40,958 --> 00:30:43,500
Dan kenapa kancingmu terbuka?
Pamer rompi?

575
00:30:43,666 --> 00:30:45,250
Kalian ini kader partai.

576
00:30:45,333 --> 00:30:46,375
Sedikit premanisme tidak apa,

577
00:30:46,625 --> 00:30:48,125
tapi jangan terlihat seperti preman.

578
00:30:48,666 --> 00:30:49,583
Mengerti?

579
00:31:00,208 --> 00:31:02,000
Deepika David.

580
00:31:02,291 --> 00:31:03,250
- Halo!
- Hai!

581
00:31:03,708 --> 00:31:04,583
Kau berdoa untuk apa?

582
00:31:04,916 --> 00:31:06,208
- Untukmu!
- Tentu saja!

583
00:31:07,791 --> 00:31:09,250
- Ya.
- Ayo!

584
00:31:15,083 --> 00:31:15,958
Deepika.

585
00:31:16,500 --> 00:31:18,250
Iya, Pak.
Ada masalah?

586
00:31:18,458 --> 00:31:19,333
Iya.

587
00:31:21,916 --> 00:31:22,875
Kau sudah menikah?

588
00:31:23,958 --> 00:31:24,833
Tidak!

589
00:31:25,708 --> 00:31:30,083
Tapi, bermesraan
di depan umum?

590
00:31:30,166 --> 00:31:31,041
Coba jelaskan.

591
00:31:31,125 --> 00:31:33,625
Pak Polisi, kurasa ada
kesalahpahaman di sini.

592
00:31:33,958 --> 00:31:35,708
Dia Deepika David,

593
00:31:35,791 --> 00:31:37,291
dan aku tunangannya, Simon.

594
00:31:37,833 --> 00:31:39,833
Lihat? Tunanganku.

595
00:31:39,916 --> 00:31:42,500
{\an8}Sial! Sialan betul!

596
00:31:42,750 --> 00:31:43,916
{\an8}Jadi kena Rp45.000.

597
00:31:44,458 --> 00:31:46,291
Tapi Simon bilang
kami sudah bertunangan.

598
00:31:46,375 --> 00:31:48,333
Itu tarif untuk tunangan.

599
00:31:48,458 --> 00:31:49,750
Kalau bukan, Rp225.000.

600
00:31:53,916 --> 00:31:54,833
{\an8}Sekarang, Simon,

601
00:31:55,541 --> 00:31:56,416
{\an8}kembali.

602
00:31:57,750 --> 00:31:58,625
{\an8}Mishra!

603
00:31:58,791 --> 00:31:59,666
{\an8}Siap, Pak!

604
00:31:59,750 --> 00:32:00,708
{\an8}Nyalakan mobilnya.

605
00:32:01,125 --> 00:32:02,083
{\an8}Cuma dapat 3.

606
00:32:08,416 --> 00:32:09,375
Ada acara apa?

607
00:32:09,833 --> 00:32:13,208
Aku pergi ke Kanpur
dan pulang tangan kosong?

608
00:32:14,875 --> 00:32:16,666
Cuma 1 rudal udara?

609
00:32:17,291 --> 00:32:20,333
Aku layak dapat serangan penuh hari ini.

610
00:32:23,333 --> 00:32:24,208
Apa yang terjadi?

611
00:32:24,458 --> 00:32:27,250
Aku sadar kau sedang kerja,

612
00:32:27,333 --> 00:32:28,666
jadi aku berhenti.

613
00:32:29,833 --> 00:32:30,708
Kau tahu...

614
00:32:31,208 --> 00:32:32,625
3 orang ini dalam radarku.

615
00:32:33,250 --> 00:32:35,875
Tapi aku punya kecurigaan kuat
pada yang tengah.

616
00:32:36,000 --> 00:32:37,291
Chanchal Kumari!

617
00:32:37,541 --> 00:32:38,583
Kenapa dia?

618
00:32:39,291 --> 00:32:40,916
2 yang lain juga cantik.

619
00:32:41,000 --> 00:32:42,208
Itu...

620
00:32:44,291 --> 00:32:45,166
firasat.

621
00:32:46,000 --> 00:32:46,875
Aku percaya itu.

622
00:32:47,041 --> 00:32:48,750
Dan aku ingin tidur.

623
00:32:49,625 --> 00:32:51,291
Aku harus ke Kanpur besok.

624
00:32:53,000 --> 00:32:54,708
Aku berpikir untuk ke Banaras.

625
00:32:54,791 --> 00:32:55,708
Banaras?!

626
00:32:57,291 --> 00:32:58,166
Kenapa Banaras?

627
00:32:58,250 --> 00:33:00,000
Kenapa kau gelisah?

628
00:33:00,791 --> 00:33:03,833
Ke mana lagi aku mencari
pacar Sunny Tiwari?

629
00:33:03,916 --> 00:33:04,791
Ke kantormu?

630
00:33:05,208 --> 00:33:07,125
Kenapa kau harus ke kantorku?

631
00:33:07,208 --> 00:33:08,791
Dia di Banaras,
jadi kau harus ke sana.

632
00:33:08,875 --> 00:33:10,708
- Persis!
- Baik! Pergi ke Banaras.

633
00:33:38,042 --> 00:33:38,958
Nilo!

634
00:33:41,125 --> 00:33:42,625
Apa yang kau lakukan di sini?

635
00:33:43,250 --> 00:33:44,625
Audisi untuk <i>Roadies.</i>

636
00:33:45,625 --> 00:33:46,750
Ini rumahku.

637
00:33:47,000 --> 00:33:48,458
Kau tidak jadi ke Kanpur?

638
00:33:48,833 --> 00:33:49,916
Kenapa aku harus ke Kanpur?

639
00:33:50,333 --> 00:33:51,750
Untuk proyek rehabilitasi kura-kura.

640
00:33:52,333 --> 00:33:53,291
Kura-kura apa?

641
00:33:53,791 --> 00:33:56,583
Itu sudah selesai
di Kanpur 4 tahun lalu.

642
00:33:56,875 --> 00:33:58,291
Ini yang baru.

643
00:33:58,500 --> 00:34:00,666
Pandey ji yang menangani
proyek itu di Kanpur.

644
00:34:00,791 --> 00:34:02,041
Kukira kau bersamanya.

645
00:34:02,583 --> 00:34:04,000
Pandey ada di Kanpur?

646
00:34:04,333 --> 00:34:05,208
Iya!

647
00:34:05,541 --> 00:34:06,416
Untuk kura-kura?

648
00:34:06,625 --> 00:34:07,500
Iya!

649
00:34:07,583 --> 00:34:08,458
Lalu kau mau ke mana?

650
00:34:08,541 --> 00:34:09,416
Banaras.

651
00:34:09,583 --> 00:34:10,458
Untuk apa?

652
00:34:10,750 --> 00:34:12,458
Untuk pekerjaan.

653
00:34:12,958 --> 00:34:14,750
Dia tidak bilang soal Kanpur padamu?

654
00:34:15,833 --> 00:34:17,166
Ya...

655
00:34:17,708 --> 00:34:18,833
Dia bilang.

656
00:34:19,333 --> 00:34:20,958
Aku samar-samar ingat sekarang.

657
00:34:21,125 --> 00:34:22,958
Kalian berdua ada-ada saja.

658
00:34:23,208 --> 00:34:24,125
Baiklah, sampai jumpa!

659
00:34:24,250 --> 00:34:25,416
Tentu...
Dadah, dadah, dadah.

660
00:34:25,500 --> 00:34:26,375
Pergi.

661
00:34:27,708 --> 00:34:30,583
Kura-kura siapa yang kau
rehabilitasi di Kanpur, Pandey?

662
00:34:31,541 --> 00:34:33,583
{\an8}<i>Aku tahu kau berusaha maksimal.</i>

663
00:34:34,291 --> 00:34:37,583
{\an8}<i>Tapi tolong urus surat-surat
ke Kanada dalam 8 hari.</i>

664
00:34:38,333 --> 00:34:42,333
<i>Menghindari ayahmu
dan anak buahnya sendiri tidak mudah.</i>

665
00:34:42,958 --> 00:34:46,583
<i>Dan aku tidak sepenuhnya sendirian.</i>

666
00:34:47,541 --> 00:34:49,291
<i>Prajapati Pandey bersamaku.</i>

667
00:34:49,833 --> 00:34:50,750
<i>Dia teman.</i>

668
00:34:51,125 --> 00:34:52,375
<i>Dia sangat mendukung.</i>

669
00:34:52,958 --> 00:34:53,833
<i>Bagaimana?</i>

670
00:34:54,208 --> 00:34:55,833
<i>Akan kujelaskan saat kita bertemu.</i>

671
00:34:56,291 --> 00:34:57,416
{\an8}<i>Jaga diri.</i>

672
00:34:59,666 --> 00:35:02,666
Ada pertemuan
dengan tim humas dan kader partai.

673
00:35:04,375 --> 00:35:05,291
Kau ikut?

674
00:35:06,208 --> 00:35:07,083
Ikut, Ayah.

675
00:35:07,708 --> 00:35:08,625
Apa yang kau baca?

676
00:35:11,833 --> 00:35:13,666
{\an8}STARBUZZ

677
00:35:14,416 --> 00:35:15,291
Tidak ada...

678
00:35:15,375 --> 00:35:18,500
Kau sudah baca manifesto pemilu
yang kita siapkan?

679
00:35:20,000 --> 00:35:22,791
Ngapain dibaca?
Itu tidak ada di majalah Bollywood.

680
00:35:23,333 --> 00:35:24,875
Ada di meja di ruang kerjaku.

681
00:35:25,250 --> 00:35:26,166
Bawa sekalian.

682
00:35:26,250 --> 00:35:27,333
Omong kosong Bollywood ini,

683
00:35:27,958 --> 00:35:29,166
harusnya ada yang bom saja.

684
00:36:09,833 --> 00:36:10,708
Kita beli minum, yuk?

685
00:36:10,791 --> 00:36:12,125
Mereka mengisap darah kita.

686
00:36:12,250 --> 00:36:13,250
Setidaknya kita bisa minum lassi.

687
00:36:13,708 --> 00:36:15,458
NOMOR 1 BANARAS

688
00:36:15,583 --> 00:36:17,166
Bang, ini yang biasa?

689
00:36:22,791 --> 00:36:23,708
Bersulang!

690
00:36:29,750 --> 00:36:30,625
Bang.

691
00:36:31,458 --> 00:36:32,666
Ini bukan yang biasa.

692
00:36:34,833 --> 00:36:36,791
Santai, tidak akan ada yang tahu.

693
00:39:01,458 --> 00:39:02,333
<i>Sunny.</i>

694
00:39:03,750 --> 00:39:04,708
<i>Sunny.</i>

695
00:39:05,583 --> 00:39:06,458
Sunny?

696
00:39:07,958 --> 00:39:08,916
Sunny!

697
00:39:09,666 --> 00:39:11,375
Kau dengar yang dikatakan Gaur sahab?

698
00:39:11,625 --> 00:39:12,583
Tidak. Apa?

699
00:39:13,541 --> 00:39:14,875
Bagaimana kalau slogan ini...

700
00:39:15,375 --> 00:39:17,250
{\an8}"Ibu satu, Ayah satu,

701
00:39:17,625 --> 00:39:19,458
{\an8}Kakak Sudhanshu, nomor satu."

702
00:39:23,000 --> 00:39:23,916
Brilian!

703
00:39:26,791 --> 00:39:27,666
<i>Dengar, Chanchal.</i>

704
00:39:27,750 --> 00:39:29,084
<i>Sedekat ini</i>

705
00:39:29,108 --> 00:39:30,666
<i>dengan pria lain itu tidak benar.</i>

706
00:39:31,041 --> 00:39:32,222
<i>Aku percaya padamu.</i>

707
00:39:32,223 --> 00:39:35,393
<i>Tapi pria itu dasarnya seperti anjing.</i>

708
00:39:35,541 --> 00:39:36,458
<i>Dan ya...</i>

709
00:39:36,750 --> 00:39:38,666
<i>Kalau kau sudah berubah hati,</i>

710
00:39:38,667 --> 00:39:39,625
<i>beritahu saja aku.</i>

711
00:39:39,833 --> 00:39:41,541
<i>Aku tidak akan menghalangimu.</i>

712
00:39:42,625 --> 00:39:43,541
Hati-hati.

713
00:39:43,625 --> 00:39:45,250
Jangan khawatir.

714
00:39:47,125 --> 00:39:48,041
Ini!

715
00:40:19,166 --> 00:40:21,541
Kekasih macam apa
yang saling lempar bunga?

716
00:40:22,875 --> 00:40:24,125
Kau pikir ini akan
meyakinkan mereka?

717
